  "title": "WordPress Nginx Config Generator - Free-Tier VPS Preset - gwillchijioke.com",
  "description": "Generate a production-ready Nginx server block for WordPress - TLS, PHP-FPM socket, static caching, security headers, and permalink rules - with a Free-tier VPS preset. Free, private, nothing is uploaded.",
  "canonical": "https://gwillchijioke.qzz.io/tools/nginx-config-generator/",
  "body": "\n<article class=\"page-tools-tool\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/WebPage\">\n<!-- ═══ 2. tool hero ═══ -->\n<section class=\"section-sm\" style=\"padding-top:var(--sp-6);padding-bottom:0;position:relative\">\n<div class=\"wrap\" style=\"max-width:var(--content-w)\">\n<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--sp-4)\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n<ol class=\"breadcrumb-list\">\n<li><a href=\"%BASE%/\" class=\"bc-home-link\"><span class=\"bc-prompt\">&gt;_</span>Home</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"%BASE%/tools/\">Tools</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"breadcrumb-current\" aria-current=\"page\">WordPress Nginx Config Generator</span></li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://gwillchijioke.qzz.io/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Tools\",\"item\":\"https://gwillchijioke.qzz.io/tools/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"WordPress Nginx Config Generator\",\"item\":\"https://gwillchijioke.qzz.io/tools/nginx-config-generator/\"}]}</script>\n<div class=\"about-hero\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--sp-6)\">\n<p class=\"label label-green\">&gt;_ tools --nginx</p>\n<div class=\"about-intro\">\n<div class=\"about-text\">\n<h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;margin:16px 0;letter-spacing:-.03em\">WordPress Nginx Config Generator</h1>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--mid);line-height:1.7;max-width:56ch\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tGenerate a production-ready Nginx server block for WordPress - TLS, PHP-FPM, static caching, security headers, and permalink rules - with a Free-tier VPS preset tuned for modest RAM. Everything runs in your browser; nothing is uploaded.\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot ad-slot--leaderboard\">\n<div class=\"ad-slot__spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"ad-spinner\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" opacity=\".25\"/>\n<path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"ad-slot__spinner-text\">Ad loading…</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot__content\">\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"desktop\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-728x90-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"728\" height=\"90\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"tablet\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-728x90-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"728\" height=\"90\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"mobile\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-320x100-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"100\"></div></template>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- ═══ 3. tool behaviour (Nginx config generator) ═══ -->\n<div id=\"ngxapp\" style=\"max-width:var(--content-w)\">\n<main class=\"ngx-wrap\">\n<div class=\"ngx-card\">\n<div class=\"sec-head\"><span class=\"ic\"></span><h2>PRESET</h2><span class=\"line\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"presets\">\n<label class=\"preset\" id=\"preset_card_free\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"preset\" value=\"free\" checked>\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"t\">Free-tier VPS <span style=\"color:var(--green)\">(default)</span></span>\n<span class=\"d\">Tuned for ~512MB - 1GB RAM. No Redis/memcached (explained in output), modest Nginx workers, conservative fastcgi timeouts so a slow plugin does not hard-504.</span></span></label>\n<label class=\"preset\" id=\"preset_card_std\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"preset\" value=\"std\">\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"t\">Standard</span>\n<span class=\"d\">Comfortable for 1-2GB. Higher worker_connections and generous timeouts; still no Redis by default.</span></span></label>\n<label class=\"preset\" id=\"preset_card_perf\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"preset\" value=\"perf\">\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"t\">Performance</span>\n<span class=\"d\">For 2GB+ with a cache plugin. Adds FastCGI cache tuning and keeps headers aggressive.</span></span></label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sec-head\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"><span class=\"ic\"></span><h2>DOMAIN &amp; TLS</h2><span class=\"line\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"grid2\">\n<label class=\"field\"><span class=\"flbl\">Server name</span><input type=\"text\" id=\"server_name\" value=\"example.com\" placeholder=\"example.com\"></label>\n<label class=\"field\"><span class=\"flbl\">SSL mode</span>\n<select id=\"ssl_mode\">\n<option value=\"letsencrypt\" selected>Let&#039;s Encrypt</option>\n<option value=\"selfsigned\">Self-signed</option>\n<option value=\"none\">None (plain HTTP)</option>\n</select></label>\n</div>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"force_https\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"force_https\" checked>\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Force HTTPS<span class=\"badge\">:80 → 443</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">Emit a separate :80 server block with return 301. Header directives stay in the 443 block only.</span></span></label>\n<div class=\"sec-head\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"><span class=\"ic\"></span><h2>PHP-FPM</h2><span class=\"line\"></span></div>\n<label class=\"field\"><span class=\"flbl\">PHP-FPM socket / upstream</span>\n<input type=\"text\" id=\"php_sock\" value=\"unix:/run/php/php8.3-fpm.sock\" placeholder=\"unix:/run/php/php8.3-fpm.sock\"></label>\n<div class=\"grid2\">\n<label class=\"field\"><span class=\"flbl\">fastcgi_read_timeout (s)</span><input type=\"number\" id=\"read_timeout\" value=\"60\" min=\"10\" max=\"600\"></label>\n<label class=\"field\"><span class=\"flbl\">client_max_body_size</span><input type=\"text\" id=\"body_size\" value=\"64M\" placeholder=\"64M\"></label>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sec-head\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"><span class=\"ic\"></span><h2>CACHING &amp; SPEED</h2><span class=\"line\"></span></div>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"static_cache\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"static_cache\" checked>\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Static asset caching<span class=\"badge\">expires</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">expires 30d for static assets.</span></span></label>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"gzip\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"gzip\" checked>\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">gzip<span class=\"badge\">on</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">Compress text/HTML/CSS/JS/JSON responses on the wire.</span></span></label>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"fcgi_cache\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"fcgi_cache\">\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">FastCGI cache (admin bypass)<span class=\"badge\">pro</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">Cache rendered pages; logged-in/admin/query-string requests bypass it. cache_path goes in http{}, not the server block.</span></span></label>\n<div class=\"sec-head\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"><span class=\"ic\"></span><h2>SECURITY</h2><span class=\"line\"></span></div>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"sec_headers\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"sec_headers\" checked>\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Hardening security headers<span class=\"badge\">add_header … always</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">X-Content-Type-Options, X-Frame-Options, Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy, HSTS. Emitted in the TLS block only.</span></span></label>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"comments_spam\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"comments_spam\" checked>\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Block comment spam / XML-RPC<span class=\"badge\">if … set</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">Deny POST to wp-comments-post.php from non-referers, and deny xmlrpc.php. Uses if … return on exact URIs (legal).</span></span></label>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"basic_auth\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"basic_auth\">\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Basic-auth placeholder<span class=\"badge\">commented</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">Commented-out auth_basic + auth_basic_user_file for /wp-admin/.</span></span></label>\n<label class=\"opt\" data-opt=\"rate_limit\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"rate_limit\">\n<span class=\"body\"><span class=\"title\">Rate/conn limit placeholders<span class=\"badge\">commented</span></span>\n<span class=\"desc\">Commented limit_req_zone/limit_conn_zone (http context) and per-location limit_req.</span></span></label>\n</div>\n<section class=\"ngx-card ngx-out\">\n<div class=\"out-cap\"><span>generated nginx server block</span><span style=\"flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--border-2)\"></span><span id=\"byteCount\" style=\"color:var(--dim)\">0 B</span></div>\n<div class=\"preview\"><code id=\"preview\"></code></div>\n<div class=\"actions\">\n<button class=\"ngx-btn ngx-p\" id=\"copyBtn\">Copy config</button>\n<button class=\"ngx-btn ngx-ghost\" id=\"dlBtn\">Download .conf</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ngx-msg\" id=\"ngx-msg\" role=\"alert\" hidden></div>\n</section>\n<footer class=\"foot\">no server · computed entirely in your browser · test with nginx -t before reloading</footer>\n"
}